%% showcase: xychart with bars and a line
%% prose: Categories run along the bottom and values up the left, on round ticks. Bars from several series stand side by side within each month; a line declared after them is drawn over them.
%% approx: Bars of several series are grouped side by side, where mermaid draws them on top of one another.
%% approx: Series titles are shown in a legend; mermaid draws no legend.
%% approx: Axis titles are horizontal (the value axis's above it) rather than rotated.
xychart-beta
    title "Diagrams rendered per month"
    x-axis Month [Jan, Feb, Mar, Apr, May, Jun]
    y-axis "Diagrams (thousands)" 0 --> 12
    bar "SVG" [4.2, 5.0, 6.1, 7.4, 8.0, 9.6]
    bar "PDF" [2.0, 2.4, 3.1, 3.0, 4.2, 5.1]
    line "Target" [5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10]
